	"descriptionMarkdown": "Designed for a No Spoon/Express Delivery run I did recently. A leaner, meaner, more early-game cousin to the \"Drifton Aloft\" series craft.\n\nThis time optimized for as small a footprint as possible, as much normal quality infrastructure as i could get away with, and with early-game research levels in mind.\nThe only quality items you'll need are a single uncommon gun turret for the V1&V2 version & 3 uncommon steam turbines for the AQ2 version.\n\nV1 for your first interplanetary space platform.\nV2 for after you unlock foundries on vulcanus.\nAQ1 for your first trips to Aquilo.\nAQ2 is the fully upgraded version of The Razorback.\nNo fusion-powered variant this time. See my \"Drifton Aloft,\" or \"Hellfire\" craft for that.\n\nLike all nuclear-powered space platforms, they need to be kick-started with an umbilical solar array. ~10-20 for the starters, ~20-50 for the AQ versions. The Aquilo versions sport a simple speed-limiter circuit when flying to&from Aquilo.",
